  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あたまを　からにして\nいっしゅん　なにかを　わすれる　ことで\nじぶんの　とくぼうを　ぐーんと　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "머리를 비워서 순간적으로\n무언가를 잊어버림으로써\n자신의 특수방어를 크게 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "將頭腦清空，\n藉由在一瞬間遺忘某些事\n大幅提高自己的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur fait le vide dans son esprit pour oublier\nses soucis. Augmente beaucoup sa Défense Spéciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gedächtnisverlust, der die Spezial-Verteidigung\nstark erhöht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario olvida sus preocupaciones y aumenta mucho\nla Defensa Especial.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa svuota per un po’ la mente per dimenticare\ni problemi. La Difesa Speciale aumenta di molto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user temporarily empties its mind to forget its\nconcerns. This sharply raises the user’s Sp. Def stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "頭を　からにして\n一瞬　なにかを　忘れることで\n自分の　特防を　ぐーんと　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "将头脑清空，\n瞬间忘记某事，\n从而大幅提高自己的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario olvida sus preocupaciones y aumenta mucho\nla Defensa Especial.",
      "version_group": {
